# Chandra, Acolyte of Flame: "-2: You may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard. If
# that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead." Bot1's graveyard holds Fiery Temper (mana value 3, exactly the
# limit) and Hidetsugu's Second Rite (4, just past it); Bot2's holds a Lightning Bolt (qualifies, but is not Bot1's). Only the
